Third-party notices for the myna-text snap
==========================================

Model components
----------------

model-disfluency-en: a MiniLM-based disfluency tagger fine-tuned by Canonical
Ltd (Apache-2.0) from Microsoft's MiniLM-L12-H384-uncased (MIT) on text
derived from SODA and Synthetic-Persona-Chat (both CC-BY-4.0). The component
carries the full attribution (NOTICE) and the Apache-2.0 text (LICENSE).

Runtimes
--------

The Python runtime of the daemon (onnxruntime, tokenizers, numpy and their
dependencies) is installed from PyPI at the versions and hashes pinned in the
Myna source tree's server/uv.lock; their licence files travel in their
distributions.
